<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main class="content-page">
  <section class="content-hero">
    <p class="content-eyebrow">Security</p>
    <h1>Built-in practices to keep your account and data safe.</h1>
    <p class="content-lead">
      We actively protect the platform using authentication controls, secure sessions, and monitoring against misuse.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="policy-list">
    <article class="policy-card">
      <h2>Secure Authentication</h2>
      <p>We support encrypted login workflows and trusted identity providers, including Google sign-in integration.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="policy-card">
      <h2>Session Protection</h2>
      <p>Automatic session timeout helps reduce unauthorized access risk when a user stays inactive for long periods.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="policy-card">
      <h2>Password Safety</h2>
      <p>Passwords are stored using one-way hashing, and plain text passwords are never saved in the database.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="policy-card">
      <h2>Input and Access Controls</h2>
      <p>Protected routes and server-side checks are used to ensure only authorized users can access sensitive operations.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="policy-card">
      <h2>Monitoring and Response</h2>
      <p>Suspicious events are reviewed quickly, and we can revoke sessions or restrict accounts when abuse is detected.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="policy-card">
      <h2>User Best Practices</h2>
      <p>Use strong passwords, avoid sharing credentials, and contact support immediately if you notice unusual account activity.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>

</body>
</html>
